{"title": "Frost of Dark Winter", "pageid": 8068, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Frost_of_Dark_Winter", "categories": ["Spells that last until long rest", "Spells", "Level 4 Spells", "Evocation spells", "Actions", "Unique Spells"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Protection_from_Energy_Cold.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Protection_from_Energy_Cold.webp/300px-Protection_from_Energy_Cold.webp, /w/images/4/41/Protection_from_Energy_Cold.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Protection_from_Energy_Cold.webp/300px-Protection_from_Energy_Cold.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Protection_from_Energy_Cold.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Frost of Dark Winter </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 4 evocation spell</a>. It is a variant of <a href=\"/wiki/Kereska%27s_Favour\" title=\"Kereska's Favour\">Kereska's Favour</a> that allows its caster to imbue themselves with the power of ice and unlock resistances and spells associated with it. It is granted by <a href=\"/wiki/Markoheshkir\" title=\"Markoheshkir\">Markoheshkir</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Embrace Kereska's ice to gain <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> damage. Your cold spells deal additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> damage equal to your <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency bonus\">proficiency bonus</a>. \n</p><p>When you deal spell damage, inflict 2 turns<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\"><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Notes\">See Notes</a>]</i></sup> of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Encrusted_with_Frost_(Condition)\" title=\"Encrusted with Frost (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frost\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Encrusted_with_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Encrusted_with_Frost_(Condition)\" title=\"Encrusted with Frost (Condition)\">Frost</a> upon the target. While attuned to Kereska's ice you can cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cone_of_Cold\" title=\"Cone of Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/25px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/38px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/50px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cone of Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/25px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cone_of_Cold\" title=\"Cone of Cold\">Cone of Cold</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Storm\" title=\"Ice Storm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/25px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/38px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/50px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ice Storm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/25px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Storm\" title=\"Ice Storm\">Ice Storm</a> each once each per <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">short rest</a>.\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cone_of_Cold\" title=\"Cone of Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/40px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/60px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/80px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cone of Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/40px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cone_of_Cold\" title=\"Cone of Cold\">Cone of Cold</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a level 5 spell (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Storm\" title=\"Ice Storm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/40px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/60px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/80px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ice Storm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/40px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Storm\" title=\"Ice Storm\">Ice Storm</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a level 4 spell (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_MAG_TheChromatic_ColdAttunement</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_TheChromatic_ColdAttunement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_TheChromatic_ColdAttunement\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Conduit_of_Kereska.27s_Ice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Conduit_of_Kereska's_Ice\"> Condition: Conduit of Kereska's Ice </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conduit_of_Kereska%27s_Ice_(Condition)\" title=\"Conduit of Kereska's Ice (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conduit of Kereska's Ice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Generic_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conduit_of_Kereska%27s_Ice_(Condition)\" title=\"Conduit of Kereska's Ice (Condition)\">Conduit of Kereska's Ice</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> damage.</li>\n<li>Its cold spells deal additional damage equal to its <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency bonus\">proficiency bonus</a>.</li>\n<li>When it deals spell damage, it inflicts 2 turns of <a href=\"/wiki/Encrusted_with_Frost_(Condition)\" title=\"Encrusted with Frost (Condition)\">Encrusted with Frost</a> upon the target.</li>\n<li>While attuned to Kereska's ice, it can cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cone_of_Cold\" title=\"Cone of Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/25px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/38px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/50px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cone of Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/25px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cone_of_Cold\" title=\"Cone of Cold\">Cone of Cold</a> at 5th level and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Storm\" title=\"Ice Storm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/25px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/38px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/50px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ice Storm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/25px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Storm\" title=\"Ice Storm\">Ice Storm</a> at 4th level once per short rest.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Markoheshkir\" title=\"Markoheshkir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Markoheshkir\" title=\"Markoheshkir\">Markoheshkir</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kereska%27s_Favour\" title=\"Kereska's Favour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp/40px-Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp/60px-Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp/80px-Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kereska's Favour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp/40px-Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Kereska%27s_Favour\" title=\"Kereska's Favour\">Kereska's Favour</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The in-game tooltip says this effect inflicts 1 turn of Encrusted with Frost, but it actually inflicts 2 turns.</li>\n<li>Applying Encrusted with Frost can only occur once per attack. A spell hitting multiple targets like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cone_of_Cold\" title=\"Cone of Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/25px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/38px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/50px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cone of Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp/25px-Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Cone_of_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cone_of_Cold\" title=\"Cone of Cold\">Cone of Cold</a> will only apply the condition to a single target.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715041849\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.110 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.117 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5212/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 76055/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 35598/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1528754/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n114.77%  111.101     62 Template:Trim\n100.00%   96.802      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   96.802      1 -total\n 23.28%   22.538     14 Template:Icon_text\n 15.78%   15.275      2 Template:Spell_action\n 15.20%   14.710      8 Template:Icon_link\n 13.19%   12.769      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n  9.19%    8.